{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728 Hello, traveler! \u2728<br><br>Our game is still in testing, so you may encounter bugs or unfinished features. That\u2019s okay \u2014 we\u2019re still on the road to the final version \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4f We need your help:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your progress, impressions, and bugs in our <strong>Discord channel</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take a moment to fill out the short <strong>Google Forms survey (&quot;statistics&quot; in links)</strong>\u00a0\u2014 your feedback will make the game better.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for testing with us and helping the game grow! \ud83d\udc9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a stork egg - an unusual hero without arms and legs that fell out of the nest. Its only abilities are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll - use inertia to move along the track.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump - overcome chasms and traps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash - accelerate to pass difficult sections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/extras/b3654265565a79006c39ed522700a6b5.avif?t=1771941199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of a platformer and a physics puzzle. Each challenge requires agility, precision, and a sense of balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/extras/2d4630bdf758829563cee109e17523a4.avif?t=1771941199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to guide the egg through all the obstacles and bring it home?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953900?t=1771941199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953900?t=1771941199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/d801a41da07820588e5933dfbcde5f37460ad161/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771941199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/d801a41da07820588e5933dfbcde5f37460ad161/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771941199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728 Hello, traveler! \u2728<br><br>Our game is still in testing, so you may encounter bugs or unfinished features. That\u2019s okay \u2014 we\u2019re still on the road to the final version \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4f We need your help:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your progress, impressions, and bugs in our <strong>Discord channel</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take a moment to fill out the short <strong>Google Forms survey (&quot;statistics&quot; in links)</strong>\u00a0\u2014 your feedback will make the game better.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for testing with us and helping the game grow! \ud83d\udc9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a stork egg - an unusual hero without arms and legs that fell out of the nest. Its only abilities are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll - use inertia to move along the track.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump - overcome chasms and traps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash - accelerate to pass difficult sections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/extras/b3654265565a79006c39ed522700a6b5.avif?t=1771941199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of a platformer and a physics puzzle. Each challenge requires agility, precision, and a sense of balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/extras/2d4630bdf758829563cee109e17523a4.avif?t=1771941199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to guide the egg through all the obstacles and bring it home?</p>","developers":["LeafX Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953900/877a659ab9fecbff0d4805b2e3adb7e7e18bd5d0/header.jpg?t=1771941199","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3953900/1362772479/29c152319060f6e200618b6dc7cb8ddcb744533a